---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import Breadcrumbs from '../components/Breadcrumbs.astro';

const title = 'Contact DF TOOLS – Report a Data Error';
const description =
  'Contact DF TOOLS: report wrong values, request a tool or a data update, or ask about the methodology. We read everything.';
---

<Base title={title} description={description}>
  <Breadcrumbs items={[{ name: 'Contact' }]} />
  <div class="page-head">
    <h1>Contact</h1>
    <div class="h1-bar"></div>
    <p class="lede">
      Wrong value in the chart? Tool behaving oddly? Patch changed the meta? Tell us — data corrections are the
      most valuable thing this site receives.
    </p>
  </div>

  <section class="prose">
    <h2>Email</h2>
    <p>
      <strong>hello@deltaforcetools.top</strong><br />
      <!-- [NEEDS DATA]: set up this mailbox (e.g. via your domain's email forwarding) before launch. -->
      Typical response time: a few days. Include the page URL and, for data reports, the patch number you tested on.
    </p>

    <h2>What to include in a data report</h2>
    <ol class="steps">
      <li>The page and the exact value you think is wrong (e.g. "TTK calculator, same-tier penetration").</li>
      <li>How you tested it — in-game test, patch notes, datamine, community source.</li>
      <li>The patch version you observed it on.</li>
    </ol>

    <h2>Requests</h2>
    <p>
      Tool ideas are welcome — especially ones that need math you keep doing by hand. The roadmap lives on the{' '}
      <a href="/changelog/">changelog</a>; anything listed as "planned" is already queued.
    </p>
  </section>
</Base>
